S投稿、YouTubeでのサムネイル、配信画面\n不可なものがありましたら使用致しませんので、ご教示頂けたらと思います。\n\n納品形式としては、可能でしたらPSD、また、背景透過のものも頂けますと幸いです。\n\nSkeb不慣れの為、何か失礼や間違いがありましたら申し訳ございません…！\n大変お手数をお掛け致しますが、ご検討の程宜しくお願い致します。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1uUNQTeL9rzMF6oia_AlpKVn7DhnzOVxB/view?usp=drivesdk\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1uUNQTeL9rzMF6oia_AlpKVn7DhnzOVxB/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@saka_14_8/works/26", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5f264f8b/uploads/origins/f06fd37e-4f90-4136-aa76-b6ccca7103be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c54ec1193e29f2b68e73fb59a13b0a6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5f264f8b/uploads/origins/f06fd37e-4f90-4136-aa76-b6ccca7103be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c54ec1193e29f2b68e73fb59a13b0a6, https://si.imgix.net/5f264f8b/uploads/origins/f06fd37e-4f90-4136-aa76-b6ccca7103be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6bd4ce352f25877adf7bfa98535fd900 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5f264f8b/uploads/origins/f06fd37e-4f90-4136-aa76-b6ccca7103be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=81a9f01736fa10951da134b482998184 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "My character is a relaxed camper that likes to be as comfortable as possible. He likes to spend a lot of time in the forest during the day or next to a campfire at night. Please draw them however you would like to.\n\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/Ey_N1xbXEAUVoxE?format=jpg&name=4096x4096", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@saka_14_8/works/25", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4faf452d/uploads/origins/35504068-d2b1-4e6e-85db-78cfb23ad129?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=32f9ee460792f92b07a9a11d6ad6dce4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4faf452d/