ash. She survived but has burn scars on her left hand, so she always wears gloves. She remains as an airship ground crew as memories of the past.\n\nReferences:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1LYCrru3i1pq7st94SIegHByIi3A-eL5x\nOutfit up to you! Suggest for pose- enjoying a potato stew, something homely  & warm feel\n\nExtra:\nCan you add an extra ブレイドヘア in her hair on her left side (viewer right)?\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1OhRrDczA-vKrnZpD0RdHwd9K_kgEM3LA/view?usp=sharing\n\nThank you!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@saka_14_8/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/db6204bf/requests/274849_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=186b1cd138eac68a24dd4f18bda5dcd3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/db6204bf/requests/274849_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=186b1cd138eac68a24dd4f18bda5dcd3, https://si.imgix.net/db6204bf/requests/274849_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ce55838bbab905e9be9e10e40faa4e0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/db6204bf/requests/274849_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b73445e15dc0befa3294eee37226ea3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして、こんにちは。とても可愛いイラストに惹かれてリクエスト送りました！\n\nもしよろしければURL添付の画像の女の子をお願い出来ないでしょうか？オリジナルのキャラクターです。\nドヤ顔でダブルピースしているイラスト希望です。\nご検討よろしくお願い致します！\n\nhttps://twitter.com/kgajptmd/status/1359733583305347076?s=19", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@saka_14_8/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/772c10a6/requests/272507_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f094fd142fbd77aef4958b6ba4e3a1d6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/772c10a6/requests/272507_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f094fd142fbd77aef4958b6ba4e3a1d6, https://si.imgix.net/772c10a6/requests/272507_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompres